<title>SLOVAKIA: SLOVAK FINMIN SETS 5-WEEK T-BILL AUCTION FOR WED.</title>
<headline>SLOVAK FINMIN SETS 5-WEEK T-BILL AUCTION FOR WED.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Slovak finance ministry on Wednesday will auction an unspecified tranche of five-week T-bills, the National Bank of Slovakia (NBS) said on Monday.</p>
<p>In the ministry's last auction of simmilar T-bills on May 23, the average yield hit 6.591 percent, after 6.875 percent on March 21.</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-210-3687</p>
</text>
